1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,201
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03,251 --> 00:00:05,978
AI for Teens, video 7.

3
00:00:06,028 --> 00:00:10,270
Generative AI: useful, not oracle.

4
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,948
Chat models predict likely text.

5
00:00:13,998 --> 00:00:18,010
They can be fluent and wrong in the same paragraph.

6
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:23,373
A chatbot predicts the next word again and again.

7
00:00:23,423 --> 00:00:28,610
That fluency can hide mistakes, so you verify important claims.

8
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:35,084
Check facts with a textbook, teacher or trusted site.

9
00:00:35,134 --> 00:00:38,899
Do not paste passwords or personal IDs.

10
00:00:38,949 --> 00:00:40,757
Say when AI helped.

11
00:00:40,807 --> 00:00:43,300
Rewrite in your own words.

12
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:49,931
Good prompts ask for explanations without sharing personal details.

13
00:00:49,981 --> 00:00:53,750
Bad prompts ask for home addresses or passwords.

14
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,676
Let us recap.

15
00:00:56,726 --> 00:00:59,141
Fluency is not truth.

16
00:00:59,191 --> 00:01:04,071
Verify, protect privacy, disclose AI help.

17
00:01:04,121 --> 00:01:08,180
Next: Project: scoped AI prototype.
